      why_backup: 'An archive on your PC does not replace a backup of the PC. So copy the archive folder to an external drive from time to time.',
      why_note: 'MailArchy only reads your mailboxes. It deletes, moves and marks nothing there – the mailbox stays exactly as it is.',
