      hero_title: '<span class="zeile">Free email archive</span> <span class="zeile">for Windows</span>',
      hero_lead: "MailArchy keeps the emails from your mailboxes, Outlook and Thunderbird in a searchable archive on your own PC – complete, independent of your provider and encrypted if you wish. Your mailboxes are only read, never changed. Free, also for businesses and clubs. No account, no cloud, open source.",
